Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:07:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] A running chat's model and effort; attachments kept with the
 conversation

POST /v1/sessions/{name}/model sets them: Claude Code at once (set_model, effortLevel), Codex from its next turn; the conversation keeps them. An embedded berthd keeps a session's attachments in its conversation's folder, never the person's, and lets Claude Code read there (--add-dir).
---
